{"schema_version":1,"status":"complete","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01241-s00","batch":1241,"shard":0,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":0,"shard_end_exclusive":20,"translated_count":20,"entries":[{"entry_index":0,"uid":"zhcn:5d9daab5a681d822c93c6084","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"活动就到此结束了。\r\n……美丽安心泽，\r\n还真是个特别的人。","source_fingerprint":"0396990b4b76203415e04f17813e949602d377c68f6ec8824bab189d96ed47cf","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","400014"],"target_text":"Sự kiện đến đây là kết thúc.\r\n…Beauty Anshinzawa,\r\nquả thật là một người đặc biệt.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":1,"uid":"zhcn:ced5c23b1d4d6edbdc705b60","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呵，太天真了！","source_fingerprint":"e2dc4cdae952ea67d9db83aedfa72bbd9faa4782fe4541bf20de961cf6fba6a9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","40002"],"target_text":"Hừ, ngây thơ quá!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":2,"uid":"zhcn:74fc4c772fc8d6bdb01d75fa","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我发誓……必会取得胜利！","source_fingerprint":"1140cb4064cb37052452833c89b8560ff894154e41bf6164ed1fa2fc4ab35503","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","40003"],"target_text":"Tôi thề… nhất định sẽ giành chiến thắng!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":3,"uid":"zhcn:a5e54c6d5220acb9735ccf16","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"虽然会长也很开心……但没想到\r\n她会说「明天要三人一起拍照」。\r\n……这下得先抓住白仁才行了。","source_fingerprint":"23258cb0a29cf8546b11eb9bb78c9a84fb5800bd82f387059f91c48a8e626bc3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","400034"],"target_text":"Hội trưởng cũng rất vui… nhưng không ngờ\r\ncô ấy lại nói 「ngày mai ba người cùng chụp ảnh」.\r\n…Thế này thì trước tiên phải bắt được Narita Brian đã.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":4,"uid":"zhcn:091b38ae920b2b3449227af6","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呵……光明璀璨的未来……\r\n我一定会让你看见的。","source_fingerprint":"ba55cbbf6e6806f1560a5b163e0e9e924b0eb5ad6f4568a5ba9cf753e5b95e14","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","40004"],"target_text":"Hừ… một tương lai rực rỡ…\r\nTôi nhất định sẽ cho cậu thấy.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":5,"uid":"zhcn:d7ea418833d4136399f09519","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"室友都是些奇特的人……\r\n或说可疑人物。话说回来，\r\n不晓得铃鹿能不能顺利适应呢？","source_fingerprint":"8eb7a10f572abd93444de675d959fbedeb078075bd912386d20cebec6566ac8f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","400055"],"target_text":"Bạn cùng phòng toàn là những người kỳ lạ…\r\nhay đúng hơn là đáng ngờ. Mà nói mới nhớ,\r\nkhông biết Suzuka có thích nghi ổn thỏa không nhỉ?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":6,"uid":"zhcn:cd2d8546f10415087570ff83","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"这个夏天……我一直在讲一些……\r\n不像是我会说的话。\r\n……不，这也是回忆吧。","source_fingerprint":"b72d9b07da953a08713d222a8695b2da35584c2495ac9b2381980527d0431c72","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","400057"],"target_text":"Mùa hè này… tôi cứ nói ra những điều…\r\nchẳng giống lời mình thường nói chút nào.\r\n…Không, đây cũng là một kỷ niệm nhỉ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":7,"uid":"zhcn:beee3c4bb7e84f7f0dd20cde","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要走啰！","source_fingerprint":"2def9cbddf426f2e510518e2aa76acba4dcf13fc1e2188693a59eff56340783c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","410000"],"target_text":"Đi thôi!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":8,"uid":"zhcn:1126fcf00507d4ab94ec91b5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"理所当然的结果！","source_fingerprint":"0bc719b760ae3350f43470c39dbce95336eb655d2b94b16f2c274f0b32bf63cf","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","410001"],"target_text":"Kết quả đương nhiên!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":9,"uid":"zhcn:ff0af6effce2058b27e08437","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好。","source_fingerprint":"061dc3a2e5c7e436c621c77aa82c3cb6759345d51a920b40239a336272405fc7","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","410002"],"target_text":"Được.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":10,"uid":"zhcn:03121897a2e2f9f0e82bdbb0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好。","source_fingerprint":"061dc3a2e5c7e436c621c77aa82c3cb6759345d51a920b40239a336272405fc7","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","410003"],"target_text":"Được.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":11,"uid":"zhcn:fcc8d14abfb32f52ee245363","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呼……","source_fingerprint":"859051e831aa125febaf30affc00b2a41c40ac4b8d2ac6c3e681bad9b0d37a18","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","410004"],"target_text":"Phù…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":12,"uid":"zhcn:d9095cd7df4e0a0f32269deb","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呼……","source_fingerprint":"859051e831aa125febaf30affc00b2a41c40ac4b8d2ac6c3e681bad9b0d37a18","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","410005"],"target_text":"Phù…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":13,"uid":"zhcn:63f61d4a1fc3fb373d3c3a3a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔唔……","source_fingerprint":"1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","410006"],"target_text":"Ưm…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":14,"uid":"zhcn:d4353910fab359ef3791c2a5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔唔……","source_fingerprint":"1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","410007"],"target_text":"Ưm…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":15,"uid":"zhcn:77cfb052cc56be219475a489","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔唔……","source_fingerprint":"1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","410008"],"target_text":"Ưm…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":16,"uid":"zhcn:5ba393eb5669eda8fc73687c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我会让这场Live\r\n不辜负「女帝」之名。","source_fingerprint":"fb8e5f345dff76c8a34e269cfc0aea63986afda8cd658665df81288a50491b43","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","60000"],"target_text":"Tôi sẽ khiến Live này\r\nxứng đáng với danh hiệu 「Nữ Đế」.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":17,"uid":"zhcn:47ee223dd7da89500f7be062","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"Live也要完美呈现。","source_fingerprint":"0ee2ccbcaaab532cfac75bbbd972ebbbed503f36b0db2a6270967defd2dbb5d1","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","60001"],"target_text":"Live cũng phải được trình diễn hoàn hảo.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":18,"uid":"zhcn:046044eca48bbb0c30f16c9e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"无论何时何地都要好好打起精神。","source_fingerprint":"3c18be14690e7fe24927ba2609b9ddef75fca15009011357fb608a13e0a579db","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","70000"],"target_text":"Dù lúc nào hay ở đâu cũng phải giữ tinh thần cho tốt.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":19,"uid":"zhcn:65b939b9dbe8fe2fcf4f2f15","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"当时的我要是知道你成了\r\n签约训练员……一定会非常惊讶吧。\r\n毕竟我现在都还是觉得难以置信。","source_fingerprint":"a3952cabde2cb897c9e144eeeec937e7a3b0ede629a3d47d445a9c0fdc955663","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","70001"],"target_text":"Nếu tôi lúc đó biết cậu đã trở thành\r\nTrainer ký hợp đồng… chắc hẳn sẽ vô cùng kinh ngạc.\r\nBởi ngay cả bây giờ tôi vẫn thấy khó tin.","reviewed":true}]}